{"version":1,"content":"<p>《GTA6》發售初期，罪惡都市的一面隧道壁畫在玩家社區引起討論。它藉助道路、隧道入口和縱深效果營造出可通行的假象，多名玩家及主播駕車經過時未能及時辨認，直接撞上牆面。<br/></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587794.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:03:54.537805+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T03:43:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:57:16.332982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:57:16.332982+00:00","content_hash":"1770153830f8f7eb66aeb055432ec1f378241c4f2c15d3fe7a90889f9b92c009","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}